WorkX brings AI agents into governed enterprise processes. Agents provide intelligence; WorkX provides the process, state, controls and accountability.

| Layer                        | Agent SDK                   | WorkX                            |
| ---------------------------- | --------------------------- | -------------------------------- |
| Reasoning                    | **Strong**                  | Not the point                    |
| Tool selection               | **Strong**                  | Govern/coordinate                |
| Agent loop                   | **Strong**                  | Coordinate where necessary       |
| Agent memory/context         | SDK capability              | Process/business state           |
| Business process             | Limited                     | **Core strength**                |
| Long-running state           | Not the primary abstraction | **Core strength**                |
| Human approval               | Agent-level capability      | **Enterprise workflow**          |
| SLA/timers/escalation        | Not the primary abstraction | **Core strength**                |
| Audit trail                  | Agent trace                 | **Business-process audit trail** |
| Cross-system orchestration   | Tools                       | **Process orchestration**        |
| Existing BPMN                | No                          | **Yes**                          |
| Deterministic + agentic flow | Possible                    | **Core proposition**             |
| Enterprise governance        | SDK-level                   | **Process-level governance**     |

